#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#A synthesized cross slope sine sweep road is used to excite the ride dynamics of a vehicle.
#
#The vehicle linked to this example is the D-Class sedan with five acceleration and rate sensors. The acceleration and rate sensors simulate the accelerometers and rate sensors you would instrument a test vehicle with.
#
#You can use the plots and animation to analyze the results of this test to study and understand the effects this type of road has on the tire and damper forces, suspension behavior, etc.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

